        "id": "rust-sort-rejected",
        "moduleId": "why-ordering",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "code",
        "title": "教材：被编译器拒绝的浮点排序",
        "markdown": "教材用一个 Rust 例子开场：把 `[1.0, -3.5, 4.7]` 这样的浮点数组交给 `sort()`，编译会失败，错误信息指出 `{float}` 没有实现 `Ord` trait。在 Rust 中，`Ord` 表示的全序关系（total order）正是排序所需要的性质。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-cf3aa79f1cccb75df1c64c0a",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000010"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "底层的浮点数",
                "浮点数能建立全序关系吗？"
              ],
